# Empty States

Empty states guide users when there's no data to display.

## When to Use

- First-time user experience (no data yet)
- Search/filter returns no results
- List is empty after deletion
- No items match current filters

## Canonical component

Use the shared `EmptyState` molecule at `apps/web/src/components/molecules/EmptyState.tsx`.

```tsx
import { EmptyState } from '@/components/molecules/EmptyState';

<EmptyState
  scene="noVariants"
  title="No variants yet"
  description="Generate platform variants from your published content."
  actionLabel="Generate variants"
  onAction={handleGenerate}
/>
```

### Props

| Prop | Notes |
|------|-------|
| `scene` | Inline SVG illustration id — preferred for Content Pipeline and other polished surfaces |
| `icon` | Lucide icon fallback when no `scene` is set |
| `title` / `description` | Required copy; keep brief and actionable |
| `actionLabel` / `onAction` | Primary CTA |
| `secondaryActionLabel` / `onSecondaryAction` | Optional secondary CTA |
| `variant` | `'default'` (elevated) or `'onboarding'` (step cards + pro tips) |
| `density` | `'default'` (`py-14`) or `'compact'` (`py-8`) — use `compact` for in-section fitness empties |

### Content Pipeline scene keys

| Scene | Use when |
|-------|----------|
| `actionRequired` | Missing both source content and brand profile |
| `noSource` | No PUBLISHED/PIPELINED workbench content |
| `noProfile` | No active Brand Identity profile |
| `noVariants` | Generated variants list is empty |
| `filteredEmpty` | Pillar or variant filters hide all items |
| `queueEmpty` | Publish Queue has no scheduled items |

Scenes live in `apps/web/src/components/molecules/empty-state/EmptyStateScenes.tsx`.

### Health & Fitness scene keys

Use `density="compact"` and **always** include a primary CTA. Contract: `docs/contracts/fitness-empty-state-system-contract-spec.md`.

| Scene | Use when |
|-------|----------|
| `recoveryCheckIn` | No recovery row for selected day (`DailyRecoveryCard`) |
| `pantryEmpty` | Pantry list empty after load (`PantryManager`) |
| `auraCorrelation` | Aura chart gated (`n < 7` paired days) |
| `rewardsQuickClaim` | No active manual reward rules |
| `rewardsRules` | No reward rules configured |
| `rewardsClaims` | No claims in last 14 days |

**Knowledge Vault Inbox:** per-bucket empties use compact dashed `InboxBucketEmptyState` (not scene `EmptyState`); CTA focuses Quick Capture input.

**Content Workbench idea grids (Ideation / Vault / Trend Ideas):** compact `EmptyState` with Lucide `icon` (no new scenes) + primary CTA — Trend navigates Signal Radar Trend Stream; Vault focuses vault picker or generates; Ideation generates or focuses Generate. Contract: `content-workbench-curation` v0.6.32+.

### Personal Branding / Recon Feed scene keys

Use `density="compact"` for Active feed empties. Contract: `docs/contracts/personal-branding-recon-feed-contract-spec.md`.

| Scene | Use when |
|-------|----------|
| `reconScarcity` | Zero tracked X handles or 48h high-signal scarcity probe |
| `reconAwaitingIngest` | First ingest not run yet, or caught-up Active empty |
| `filteredEmpty` | Age chip filters out all Active posts |

### Personal Branding / In-Person Events scene keys

Use `density="compact"` for Upcoming diagnostic empties. Contract: `docs/contracts/personal-branding-in-person-events-contract-spec.md` (§6 Events tab empty states).

| Scene | Use when |
|-------|----------|
| `reconAwaitingIngest` | Discovery has never run (`neverRun`) |
| `reconScarcity` | Ran but zero events matched stints/interests (`zeroMatch`) |
| `filteredEmpty` | Candidates filtered below `minFitScore` (`minFitFiltered`) |

Past section uses compact dashed card text only (no scene).

## Context-specific patterns

### No filter results

```tsx
<EmptyState
  scene="filteredEmpty"
  title="No variants match"
  description="Try adjusting platform, date, or status filters."
  actionLabel="Clear filters"
  onAction={clearFilters}
/>
```

### First-time user (icon fallback)

```tsx
import { Sparkles } from 'lucide-react';

<EmptyState
  icon={Sparkles}
  title="Welcome to Tasks!"
  description="Create your first task to start organizing your work."
  actionLabel="Create Your First Task"
  onAction={onCreate}
/>
```

## Best Practices

1. **Be helpful** — explain why it's empty and what to do next
2. **Provide action** — include a clear next step when possible
3. **Prefer `scene` in Personal Branding** — illustrated empty states match the product polish bar
4. **Keep it brief** — short title, 1–2 sentence description
5. **Stay positive** — encouraging tone, not error-like
6. **Consider context** — first-time vs filtered vs completed
